 "description": "<p>Three-piece policewoman costume in polyester: top, skirt, and thong, one size for 40-60 kg. The authority-figure lineup on the site runs nurse, secretary, cheongsam, and police - this is the police entry.</p>\n<p>The top-and-skirt construction is the classic format, and the thong arrives matching. No hat in this listing; the belt line and silhouette do the identifying work.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: top, skirt, thong</li>\n<li>Style: policewoman</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, recommended 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One size for 40-60 kg. Add your own cap if the costume needs it - the set itself is complete for wear.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Polyester policewoman uniform set with top, skirt and thong, one size for 40-60 kg, as pictured.</p>\n",
